  <text xml:base="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0497.ai_aph_ieron.meineke1839-grc1" xml:lang="grc"><body n="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0497.ai_aph_ieron.meineke1839-grc1" xml:lang="grc"><div type="edition" n="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0497.ai_aph_ieron.meineke1839-grc1" xml:lang="grc" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0497_ai_aph_ieron"><head>ΑΙ ΑΦ ΙΕΡΩΝ</head><div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="1" ana="#compiled-citation-normalized" xml:id="meineke-0497-ai_aph_ieron-1">
              <head rend="align(center)">Ι.</head>
              <quote>
                <lg>
                  <l n="1" xml:id="meineke-0497-ai_aph_ieron-1-l1">Οὐδ᾽ ὅστις αὐτῆς ἐκπίεται τὰ χρήματα.</l>
                </lg>
              </quote>
              <note type="source">Athenaeus X p. 446 e: <quote>ἐνίοτε δὲ καὶ συστέλλουσι τὸ ῑ (in futuro ἐκπίομαι), ὡς Πλάτων ἐν Ταῖς ἀφ᾽ ἱερῶν <quote>Οὐδ᾽</quote>
                </quote>
              </note>
              <pb n="617" facs="urn:hathi:hvd.hxjhbd:scan:635" />
              <note type="source">
                <quote>ὅστις κτλ.</quote>
              </note>
              <note type="apparatus">Ad <quote>αὐτῆς</quote> Th. Bergkius Comment. p. 381 subaudit <quote>πόλεως</quote>.</note>
            </div>
            <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="2" ana="#compiled-citation-normalized" xml:id="meineke-0497-ai_aph_ieron-2">
              <head>II.</head>
              <lg>
                <l n="1" xml:id="meineke-0497-ai_aph_ieron-2-l1">Δότω τὴν κιθάραν τις ἔνδοθεν</l>
                <l n="2" xml:id="meineke-0497-ai_aph_ieron-2-l2">καὶ τοὐπιπόρπαμα.</l>
              </lg>
              <note type="source">
                <bibl>Pollux X 190:</bibl>
                <quote>ἐπιπόρπαμα κιθαρῳδοῦ σκευὴ (h. e. vestis), ὡς Πλάτων ἐν Ταῖς ἀφ᾿ ἱερῶν <quote>Δότω τὴν κιθάραν</quote> κτλ.</quote>
              </note>
              <note type="apparatus">Bentleius Epistola ad Hemsterh. p. 73. <quote>δότω δὲ τήν</quote>, Porsonus Advers. p. 297, <quote>δότω μοι τήν</quote>. Possis etiam <quote>δότω τις τὴν κιθάραν τῶν ἔνδοθεν</quote>. Tum codex <quote>τοὐπιπόρματα</quote>. Correxit Hemsterhusius.</note>
            </div>
            <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="3" ana="#compiled-citation-normalized" xml:id="meineke-0497-ai_aph_ieron-3">
              <head>III.</head>
              <lg>
                <l n="1" xml:id="meineke-0497-ai_aph_ieron-3-l1">Πόθεν ὁρμιὰ καὶ κάλαμος;</l>
              </lg>
              <note type="source">
                <bibl>Hesychius</bibl>, <quote>Ἀσπαλιεύς: ἁλιεύς. ἄσπαλος γὰρ ὁ ἰχθύς. ἔνιοι δὲ ἀπὸ τοῦ σπᾶν τὸ λίνον· λίνον δὲ ἡ ὁρμιά, ὡς Πλάτων ἐν Ταῖς ἀφ᾿ ἱερῶν <quote>Πόθεν ὁρμιὰ καὶ κάλαμος;</quote>
                </quote>
              </note>
              <note type="apparatus">Requirebam <quote>πόθεν λίνον καὶ κάλαμος;</quote> Et sic citat Casaubonus ad Athen. X p. 446 e. Sed potest etiam illud verum esse.</note>
            </div>
            <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="4" ana="#compiled-citation-normalized" xml:id="meineke-0497-ai_aph_ieron-4">
              <head>IV.</head>
              <note type="source">
                <bibl>Pollux VII 57:</bibl>
                <quote>Πλάτων ἐν Ταῖς ἀφ᾿ ἱερῶν καὶ <quote>μαλλωτὰς χλαμύδας</quote> εἴρηκεν.</quote>
              </note>
            </div>
            <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="5" ana="#compiled-citation-normalized" xml:id="meineke-0497-ai_aph_ieron-5">
              <head>V.</head>
              <note type="source">
                <bibl>Antiatticista p. 106.</bibl>
                <quote>Λέπε: ἀντὶ τοῦ τύπτε. Πλάτων Ἀφιεροῦντι (sic) <quote>Λέπει τραχεῖαν ἔχων</quote>.</quote>
              </note>
              <note type="apparatus">Fortasse sequebatur <quote>μάστιγα</quote> vel simile quid. Pro <quote>λέπε</quote> et <quote>τύπτε</quote> scribendum videtur <quote>λέπει</quote> et <quote>τύπτει</quote>. De <quote>λέπειν</quote> verberare v. Ruhnk. Epist. crit. p. 208. De titulo fabulae v. Hist. crit. p. 167.</note>
            </div>
          </div></body></text></TEI>